1
00:00:02,266 --> 00:00:04,079
The sea keeps its own time.

2
00:00:04,457 --> 00:00:07,529
Twice a day, between the tides,
the water stops.

3
00:00:08,663 --> 00:00:10,629
Neap tells you when, to the minute,

4
00:00:10,809 --> 00:00:12,765
for every harbour on your coast.

5
00:00:13,219 --> 00:00:15,680
Slack water today: 14:52.

6
00:00:16,313 --> 00:00:17,902
Go when the water rests.
